OL,3,GNEWSABaby born during Harry Potter
OL,4,Ascreening has 'Cineworld' on birth
OL,5,Acertificate
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman gave birth in a cinema after
OL,8,Fgoing into labour in the middle of a
OL,9,Fmovie, with the newborn's birth
OL,10,Fcertificate officially recording the
OL,11,Funusual place of birth.
OL,13,FMolly Connah, 32, had been overdue by a
OL,14,Fday when she took her nine-year-old son
OL,15,FAlfie to see Harry Potter and the
OL,16,FPhilosopher's Stone.
OL,18,FBaby Elsie Lamb was born in the
OL,19,FCineworld at Broughton, Flintshire,
OL,20,Fwith staff assisting and paramedics
OL,21,Farriving moments later.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
